      "verbatim_text": "OMT (including beta-blocker, ACE-I, ARB or ARNI, MRA and SGLT2 inhibitors), should be continued in chronic HF patients whenever BP and haemodynamic conditions permit and considering drug interaction with infection-related therapies and side effect profile."
